method.param:
the manufacturer code of the attribute to be retrieved. If -1
        is used, the method behaves exactly like
        {@link ZCLCluster#getAttribute(int)}

method.throws:
if a handler has already been registered,
         or if this object has been closed (a {@link ZCLCommandResponse}
         which returns true from
         {@link ZCLCommandResponse#isEnd()}. After a close event the
         handler function will be dereferenced.

